    "title": "ZZ Top Extends Their Elevation Tour Into November - NewsBreak",
    "text": "ZZ Top Extends Their Elevation Tour Into November\nBy Michael Gallucci,\n13 hours agoZZ Top has extended their current Elevation Tour with a series of new shows, including dates that now take the tour into November. The group's latest tour was to conclude in early October with a date in Indiana; new shows now bring the concerts to an end in early November with a performance in Rancho Mirage, California.",
